<title>SWEDEN: Group sees 1.1 mln Swedish mobile phone sales '97.</title>
<headline>Group sees 1.1 mln Swedish mobile phone sales '97.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Swedish industry group, Mobil Tele Leverantorerna (MTL), said on Thursday it expected GSM mobile telephone sales in Sweden to total 1.1 million in 1997 compared to 925,000 in 1996.  </p>
<p>The group said in a statement sales of NMT telephones in Sweden fell to 75,000 from 140,000 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
